  "id": "wolfsdk.gore_tief",
  "name": "Gore Deep Layer",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "author": "wolfsdk",
  "description": "The layers below the behavior tables. Removes the melee block every enemy carries on its head zone (which is why knife kills never bleed in the original), and sets forceInjured on all 13 body zones instead of only the two lower legs. Blood particles stay untouched: they are streamed with a precomputed size, and any change makes the engine throw the particle away entirely.",
